			"<forward> <left> <back> <right>  move and drive     Mouse  camera (wheel: zoom)     <run>  run (on a pad, the further you push the stick, the faster you go)",
			"<interact>  talk, get in and out, steal moving cars, paint over graffiti, shove a rolled car",
			"Left click  hit on foot     <handbrake>  jump on foot · handbrake     <radio>  next station     <map>  map     <pause>  pause",
			"Crashes wear out the bodywork: repair it at garages and petrol stations (blue square on the map). At a garage you drive inside; sound the horn to say yes. 0 to 25 €, depending on the damage.",
			"Running people over, breaking things, tagging and stealing cars fills the PITUFOS bar. When it is full they hunt and ram you: lose them out of sight. Stopped for 5 seconds with one on top of you and you are caught, losing half your cash (or 100 € if you carry more than 200).",
			"Conveniently parked trailers to jump off, saffron to pick on foot, and other peñas’ walls to paint with yours.",
			"Gamepad: left stick move · right stick camera · RT/LT accelerate and brake · A talk/get in · X hit · B jump / handbrake · RB run · Start pause"]},
